,"source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究通过黑盒干预衡量语言模型生成的因素解释是否满足必要性（改变该因素会导致输出变化）或充分性（保留该因素而移除其他可变信息仍能保持输出），并把解释排名与实验得分进行相关性分析，涉及两类合成任务。","title":"Necessary or Sufficient? Evaluating LLM Explanations With Behavioural Evidence"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_814f855b295c75f7ec9d6beda5bcd0eadc1fb285e97103a75ddc251af061e548","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-designing-lifecycle-policies-for-agentcore-memory-0-c620d7b2d0/","observation_id":"obs_c620d7b2d0c6a9529b6c4a7972b85e9a5496d506de1f20cce6e3493f86273128","published_at":"2026-09-04T17:20:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这段内容介绍了如何对 AI Agent 的记忆进行生命周期管理，通过将记忆分类并采用过期时间、相关性衰减和合并三种策略定期清理记忆，使长期运行的 Agent 保持有效性并避免过时信息干扰。","title":"Designing lifecycle policies for AgentCore memory"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_92b34a0be6061e61a820efd82cb68ed3258aff13aab1b5a5091c0e4646d1f45b","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-build-a-physical-ai-model-factory-with-nvidia-cosm-0-db4572b71e/","observation_id":"obs_db4572b71eb09cccddf27d76236d4dc5d129d84d0c831a8ecd0d3b1f22ae58fe","published_at":"2026-09-04T16:16:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这条内容介绍如何利用NVIDIA Cosmos 3在Amazon SageMaker HyperPod上构建一条持续的物理AI模型生产流水线，把合成数据生成、感知与策略后训练以及闭环仿真评估统一在同一模型框架中。","title":"Build a Physical AI model factory with NVIDIA Cosmos 3 on SageMaker HyperPod"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f8aed450d9997f130322240296641f981bf00dc1f7a023b8858bb8ef296048b8","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-run-agent-driven-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-operati-0-184a451fc2/","observation_id":"obs_184a451fc248c54661fd642cd91ea7e5e5a954a4d78540e2f70a6e00078b9e56","published_at":"2026-09-04T16:12:17Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于 HyperPod InstantStart 的技术实现解读，介绍了如何通过 AI agent 驱动 SageMaker HyperPod 集群的自动化运维。该方案将集群创建、容量配置、训练和推理等工作流封装为统一的控制平面，同时提供 Web 界面和终端两种交互方式。","title":"Run ag